staff trorxek oaken ancient artifact~
The staff is a single length of oak that was never cut so much as persuaded
to leave its tree. Bark still creeps along its length, and in spring a
stubborn green shoot forces its way out near the grip. Druids say it
remembers every forest it has walked through.
~
